{
  "title": "Hearty Croatian Goat Kebabs",
  "description": "A salty and creamy Croatian dish featuring goat meat, perfect for a post-workout meal, made with a unique flambe technique and cooked on a salt block, egg-free friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Croatian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
